flowchart LR
  C[Customer: menu and modifier] --> O[Server prices and stores order]
  O --> P[Private synthetic payment proof]
  P --> V{Cashier decision}
  V -->|Reject| R[Customer resubmits proof]
  R --> V
  V -->|Verify| K[KDS terminal: channel, options, preparing, ready]
  K --> L[Cashier releases order]
  L --> D[Rider accepts, picks up, delivers]
  D --> DP[Private synthetic delivery proof]
  DP --> F[Delivered order and transaction history]
  M[Manager formal request] --> PR[Production preparation and dispatch record]
  PR --> RR[Source-linked Receiving draft]
  RR --> PA{Post accepted quantities}
  PA --> B[Batch plus movement ledger plus stock]
  RR -.->|Draft, dispatch, or rejection| N[No stock movement]
